s_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in any version from 4.5dev1 and beyond.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta6 - macOS Sequoia (15.3.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 Pro - Apple M1 Pro (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nReproducible in any version from 4.5dev1 to latest.\n\nThe remote debugger command `scene:inspect_object` was completely replaced with `scene:inspect_objects` in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99680 instead of remaining alongside the new command.\n\nThis breaks the functionality of external debuggers, such as [godot-vscode-plugin](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-vscode-plugin), that only require single-node inspection.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nReproduction:\n\n1. Open any project in Godot 4.5dev1+ (such as the latest 4.5 beta6)\n2. Try to inspect an object through an external debugger, like the vscode extension\n\nExpected: single object inspection works\nActual: command no longer supported. Debugger breaks.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis happens with any project.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos",